00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:09,000
You look much better than you did last

293
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:09,280
year.

294
00:12:09,620 --> 00:12:10,960
To say the least, Santa.

295
00:12:11,180 --> 00:12:13,160
Our little Tinkerbell paid us the honor of

296
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:13,660
the visit.

297
00:12:13,780 --> 00:12:14,440
And a tear.

298
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:16,760
Just what we needed to give us silky

299
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:17,700
smooth skin again.

300
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:21,440
Well, that's wonderful news.

301
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:24,780
Especially since I thought it'd be quite sad

302
00:12:24,780 --> 00:12:27,940
to do my annual fairy dust harvest all

303
00:12:27,940 --> 00:12:29,060
by my lonesome.

304
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:31,420
Would you do the honor of assisting me?

305
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:31,960
Of course!

306
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:42,860
There you go.

307
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:44,020
Ho-ho-ho!

308
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:44,840
Perfect!

309
00:12:45,460 --> 00:12:47,260
Ho-ho-ho!

310
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:51,440
Since you're here, Michael, maybe you could give

311
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,400
me a hand?

312
00:12:53,380 --> 00:12:55,660
I didn't want to follow you, but I

313
00:12:55,660 --> 00:12:58,060
just really, really wanted to see you some

314
00:12:58,060 --> 00:12:59,040
more, and...

315
00:12:59,040 --> 00:13:01,540
Why don't we discuss that a little bit

316
00:13:01,540 --> 00:13:02,480
later, okay?

317
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:03,880
Yes, of course!

318
00:13:05,920 --> 00:13:07,200
Ho-ho-ho!

319
00:13:07,520 --> 00:13:09,800
We'll have to find another way to carry

320
00:13:09,800 --> 00:13:10,440
this basket.

321
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,200
I have an idea.

322
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:16,840
You see?

323
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:18,180
As simple as that.

324
00:13:18,180 --> 00:13:19,220
Thanks, Michael.

325
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:21,540
It's the same thing every year.

326
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:24,480
But this time, thanks to you, it will

327
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:26,160
be a whole lot easier.

328
00:13:26,460 --> 00:13:27,880
Where exactly are we going?

329
00:13:28,380 --> 00:13:29,920
We go where I want.

330
00:13:30,140 --> 00:13:31,760
Now be quiet, a lot of you.

331
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:32,840
Pirates!

332
00:13:33,220 --> 00:13:33,860
Hurry, Michael.

333
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:36,460
Take this and get out of here.

334
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:38,580
But I can't just leave you.

335
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:40,460
Michael, do what I say.

336
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:41,340
Please.

337
00:13:41,780 --> 00:13:43,580
Do you really want to help me?

338
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:44,340
But...

339
00:13:44,340 --> 00:13:46,040
Then go warn Peter.

340
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:47,000
Okay.

341
00:13:47,340 --> 00:13:48,280
I'll go get help.

342
00:13:50,500 --> 00:13:55,400
Captain, it's Santa Claus.

343
00:13:55,740 --> 00:13:58,540
Of course it's Santa Claus.

344
00:13:58,860 --> 00:14:00,880
We're not here by chance.

345
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:04,500
Go say hello to him.

346
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:04,920
No, no.

347
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:06,520
You do it.

348
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:07,720
I'm too shy.

349
00:14:09,220 --> 00:14:11,200
Would you mind giving me your autograph?

350
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:13,220
I love what you do.

351
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:14,980
Why, of course.

352
00:14:14,980 --> 00:14:20,080
We'll capture him, you bunch of incapables!

353
00:14:20,660 --> 00:14:21,640
Capture Santa?

354
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:22,340
Yes.

355
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:23,260
Wait.

356
00:14:23,420 --> 00:14:24,160
You're joking.

357
00:14:24,500 --> 00:14:24,900
No.

358
00:14:25,540 --> 00:14:26,520
Seriously, Captain?

359
00:14:26,860 --> 00:14:27,560
Yes.

360
00:14:28,020 --> 00:14:28,800
But why?

361
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:29,780
Why?

362
00:14:30,060 --> 00:14:33,320
Because if you don't capture him immediately, I'll

363
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:36,040
make you all walk the plank one by

364
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:37,060
one!

365
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:40,720
Well, sorry about this, Santa, but you know

366
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:41,580
how it is.

367
00:14:41,740 --> 00:14:42,860
Orders are orders.

368
00:14:42,860 --> 00:14:44,840
Sure, orders are orders.

369
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:47,160
We don't have anything against you.

370
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:48,600
He does.

371
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:51,560
We don't really know why, but apparently he

372
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:52,940
doesn't care much for Christmas.

373
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:57,320
Well, this take long because it's not very

374
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:58,700
convenient for me, you know.

375
00:14:58,900 --> 00:15:01,020
I have a very busy schedule.

376
00:15:02,220 --> 00:15:03,780
Make it snappy!

377
00:15:04,780 --> 00:15:05,800
You're in luck.

378
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:08,140
The Captain must be in a hurry, too.

379
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:09,220
Very good.

380
00:15:09,460 --> 00:15:10,220
Very good.

381
00:15:10,220 --> 00:15:12,660
So, uh, where are you taking me?

382
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,180
This way, Santa.

383
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:15,620
If you please.

384
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:16,540
No!

385
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:18,440
Not if he pleases!

386
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:20,220
He's our prisoner!

387
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:22,100
You bodily fools!

388
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:26,560
Yeah!

389
00:15:26,780 --> 00:15:27,200
Yeah!

390
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:35,060
Hey, how's it going?

391
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:36,540
Having fun in there?

392
00:15:37,280 --> 00:15:38,200
Oh, yeah!

393
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:40,340
This bottomless trunk is brilliant!

394
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:43,780
And you drive a lot better than Santa

395
00:15:43,780 --> 00:15:44,360
does, Mira.

396
00:15:44,420 --> 00:15:45,500
Totally amazing!

397
00:15:45,760 --> 00:15:47,460
I have to ask Santa how he made

398
00:15:47,460 --> 00:15:47,740
this.

399
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:50,040
It'd be so useful for putting our things

400
00:15:50,040 --> 00:15:50,380
away.

401
00:15:50,620 --> 00:15:53,120
So, Michael, does this answer your question about

402
00:15:53,120 --> 00:15:55,680
how Santa manages to carry so many presents

403
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:56,840
in such a small sleigh?

404
00:15:57,100 --> 00:15:57,620
Michael?

405
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:58,800
Where is he?

406
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,000
Did anyone see Michael?

407
00:16:00,400 --> 00:16:01,460
There he is!

408
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:02,480
Whoa!

409
00:16:04,300 --> 00:16:05,600
Hang on, Michael!

410
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:06,580
I've got you!

411
00:16:15,740 --> 00:16:16,220
Whoa!

412
00:16:16,460 --> 00:16:16,800
Whoa!

413
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:27,460
He kidnapped Santa!

414
00:16:27,940 --> 00:16:28,360
What?

415
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:29,660
How do you know that?

416
00:16:29,740 --> 00:16:31,560
I told you not to follow him!

417
00:16:31,680 --> 00:16:33,380
Yeah, well, it might have been a good

418
00:16:33,380 --> 00:16:34,140
thing for once.

419
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:35,620
That lousy pirate!

420
00:16:35,620 --> 00:16:38,320
If he touches a single hair on Santa's

421
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:40,100
white beard, he'll regret it.

422
00:16:40,220 --> 00:16:41,160
I promise you.

423
00:16:41,380 --> 00:16:43,920
Lost Kids, we're going to rescue Santa Claus!

424
00:16:47,180 --> 00:16:48,100
How's that?

425
00:16:48,300 --> 00:16:49,560
Not too loose for you?

426
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:52,580
It's good and uncomfortable, I hope.

427
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:54,360
It's perfect, Captain.

428
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:57,060
Three feet?

429
00:16:58,400 --> 00:16:59,520
Five feet?

430
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:00,340
Ow!

431
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:02,140
Be quiet, would you?

432
00:17:02,220 --> 00:17:04,119
Stop clowning around, you two!

433
00:17:04,119 --> 00:17:07,220
Those flying vermin will be here soon, and

434
00:17:07,220 --> 00:17:09,099
everything needs to be ready for them.

435
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:10,940
But it's Shallou's fault.

436
00:17:11,339 --> 00:17:12,460
That's not true.

437
00:17:12,800 --> 00:17:14,460
He's the one who...

438
00:17:16,079 --> 00:17:18,200
I don't want to know!

439
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:19,859
Now get back to work!

440
00:17:20,460 --> 00:17:21,520
Your fault.

441
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:23,579
Go ahead, if you're so smart.

442
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:28,400
Shmee!

443
00:17:28,800 --> 00:17:30,680
Could you keep an eye on the work?

444
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:32,900
Because if I do it, we'll be short

445
00:17:32,900 --> 00:17:35,240
of hands, and time is of the essence.

446
00:17:35,420 --> 00:17:38,280
Speaking of that, Captain, I don't see why

447
00:17:38,280 --> 00:17:39,960
we've captured Santa Claus.

448
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:42,860
Peter Pan will certainly come to free him.

449
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:44,780
I'm counting on it, Mr. Shmee.

450
00:17:45,020 --> 00:17:46,340
I'm counting on it.

451
00:17:46,740 --> 00:17:49,860
I'm ready and waiting for Peter Pan, in

452
00:17:49,860 --> 00:17:50,920
a manner of speaking.

453
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:52,560
Hm.

454
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:55,960
Hm?

455
00:17:57,980 --> 00:17:58,840
Hey!

456
00:17:59,620 --> 00:18:01,260
Here they come, Captain!

457
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:03,600
Everything is perfect.

458
00:18:03,820 --> 00:18:05,360
My plan is ready.

459
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:09,660
Perfect.

460
00:18:11,140 --> 00:18:12,000
Charge!

461
00:18:12,120 --> 00:18:12,840
Get him!

462
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:16,360
Release him this instant, Hook!

463
00:18:16,540 --> 00:18:17,600
Of course!

464
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:20,340
Not so fast!

465
00:18:20,540 --> 00:18:20,900
It's your turn!

466
00:18:20,900 --> 00:18:22,460
Your choice, scoundrel!

467
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:24,620
Do you want to waste time beating me

468
00:18:24,620 --> 00:18:26,420
up, or do you want to save your

469
00:18:26,420 --> 00:18:28,400
precious Santa Claus?

470
00:18:31,680 --> 00:18:32,300
Oh, no!

471
00:18:33,280 --> 00:18:34,260
Too late!

472
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:39,040
Peter!

473
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:40,180
The sharks!

474
00:18:40,660 --> 00:18:42,880
This time you've gone too far!

475
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:46,280
Over here, kids!

476
00:18:46,520 --> 00:18:47,340
Help me!

477
00:18:50,900 --> 00:18:52,180
It's not working!

478
00:18:57,320 --> 00:18:57,880
Go!

479
00:18:58,200 --> 00:18:58,580
Go, go!

480
00:18:59,020 --> 00:18:59,700
Hold on!

481
00:18:59,900 --> 00:19:00,600
I'll help you!

482
00:19:02,580 --> 00:19:05,000
But, Captain, we're not going to let Santa

483
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,440
go to the sharks, are we?

484
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:12,600
Tinkerbell, do something!

485
00:19:20,900 --> 00:19:21,400
Oh, yeah!

486
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:22,780
Good job, Tinkerbell!

487
00:19:25,760 --> 00:19:26,460
I'm coming!

488
00:19:27,300 --> 00:19:28,880
That was close!

489
00:19:29,540 --> 00:19:30,360
Over here!

490
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:40,200
Are you okay?

491
00:19:40,760 --> 00:19:41,500
No harm done?

492
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:44,660
Hook, you're going to get it!

493
00:19:47,420 --> 00:19:54,780
Where did it go?

494
00:20:00,640 --> 00:20:03,360
Um, Captain, why did we abandon the ship?

495
00:20:03,500 --> 00:20:05,140
That's pretty odd, isn't it?

496
00:20:06,020 --> 00:20:09,360
Kidnapping Santa was just a diversion to reach

497
00:20:09,360 --> 00:20:10,660
our real goal.

498
00:20:11,060 --> 00:20:12,860
We have a real goal?

499
00:20:13,340 --> 00:20:15,440
If someone would have informed me there was

500
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:18,720
a real goal, I would have understood better.

501
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:21,140
Gentlemen!

502
00:20:22,080 --> 00:20:25,260
We're going to take over Santa Claus's world!

503
00:20:25,260 --> 00:20:26,040
Workshop!

504
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:28,140
You see now?

505
00:20:28,520 --> 00:20:29,540
That's clear.

506
00:20:30,040 --> 00:20:33,040
A whole lot clearer than a stupid drawing.

507
00:20:39,750 --> 00:20:40,710
No one here!

508
00:20:41,190 --> 00:20:42,750
No one here either.

509
00:20:42,850 --> 00:20:45,250
As far as stupid plans go, they really

510
00:20:45,250 --> 00:20:46,130
did it this time.

511
00:20:46,390 --> 00:20:48,530
Capturing Santa to vanish at the last second?

512
00:20:48,830 --> 00:20:49,590
How ridiculous!

513
00:20:50,130 --> 00:20:53,130
Well, not as stupid as all that, Peter.

514
00:20:53,430 --> 00:20:56,730
Because I'm really behind schedule now, I'll never

515
00:20:56,730 --> 00:20:59,150
be able to deliver the presents in time.

516
00:21:00,710 --> 00:21:02,990
Not if we give you a little hand.

517
00:21:03,190 --> 00:21:05,490
Well, since you make such a nice offer,

518
00:21:05,870 --> 00:21:07,790
I suppose a little help at the workshop

519
00:21:07,790 --> 00:21:09,130
would be a good thing.

520
00:21:09,390 --> 00:21:11,190
We're going to see your workshop?

521
00:21:24,890 --> 00:21:26,750
The sleigh is now leaving.

522
00:21:29,150 --> 00:21:31,790
Please keep your hands inside the sleigh and

523
00:21:31,790 --> 00:21:33,570
don't get out until we come to a

524
00:21:33,570 --> 00:21:34,830
complete stop.

525
00:21:36,210 --> 00:21:37,210
Hi-ya!

526
00:21:43,130 --> 00:21:46,050
Ho-ho-ho-ho-ho-ho!

527
00:21:47,770 --> 00:21:50,650
He who laughs last, laughs longest.

528
00:21:53,310 --> 00:21:55,890
Ho-ho-ho-ho-ho-ho!

529
00:21:58,970 --> 00:22:04,890
We will fly all over the world, all

530
00:22:04,890 --> 00:22:09,010
over the sky, all over time.
